  "rows": {
    "10.80.30.40(1)": {
      "explanation": "In the RM zone, maximum lot coverage is the percentage shown on the Lot Coverage Overlay Map; where the map shows none, there is no coverage limit. On a major street, townhouses and apartment buildings may cover up to 50 percent. A houseplex, or a home with a secondary suite, may cover up to 45 percent where the map value is lower.",
